OL,3,GNEWSATwo women admit police assaults at
OL,4,Amigrant protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo women have admitted assaulting
OL,7,Fpolice officers during an anti-migrant
OL,8,Fprotest.
OL,10,FHundreds of demonstrators turned up at
OL,11,Fthe former Haslar naval base in
OL,12,FGosport, Hampshire, on Tuesday,
OL,13,Fbelieving that a group of asylum
OL,14,Fseekers would be landing after being
OL,15,Fpicked up in the Channel.
OL,17,FSally Pearson, 31 caused ligament
OL,18,Fdamage to an officer when she punched
OL,19,Fhim, and Shannon Dodds, 32, sprayed an
OL,20,Funknown substance into the officers'
OL,21,Ffaces, Portsmouth Magistrates' Court
OL,22,Fheard.
